#showas:元帅计划
A fairly unique challenge for many reasons, this map features not 1, not 2, but.... 10 AIs! but don't panic, this isn't as tough as it sounds and I would rate it easier than Fields of the Fortress King. This setup is all about sneaking, keeping a cool head and using some of the more unique traits of the Necromancer faction, but it can be dangerous to wait too long, as a D10 allied with Kindness is always a threat.

This map is a save file, you can regenerate the map in a edit setup if you wish, but for intended gameplay, place your homeplanet 7-8 planets away from one corner of the ring (same as the save file), the rest will generate as intended

...He's still out there, In the furthest reaches of a distant galaxy he prepares once more, AI after AI between you and him. The only sure way to be rid of this problem is the assassin's knife, but can your blade reach the head of the galaxy's most prestigious member?